+<h1>Markets today</h1>
+<ul>
+  <li id="btc">Bitcoin slides below eighty thousand dollars as crypto exchanges report heavy outflows</li>
+  <li id="gold">Gold price climbs to a record as investors look for a safe haven</li>
+  <li id="eth">Ethereum developers schedule the next network upgrade for early December</li>
+  <li id="silver">Silver futures fall six percent in a single trading session</li>
+  <li id="stocks">Stock markets slide after a hotter than expected inflation report</li>
+  <li id="stable">Stablecoin issuers face new reserve rules under the proposed regulation</li>
+  <li id="rates">Central bank holds interest rates steady and signals caution</li>
+  <li id="oil">Oil prices jump after supply disruptions in the Gulf</li>
+</ul>
+</body>
+</html>
